{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.52,
   "text": "to end up buying 12 units at one time,"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.84,
   "end": 4.58,
   "text": "three quadplexes from one owner"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.58,
   "end": 6.68,
   "text": "that was literally three doors down"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.68,
   "end": 8.8,
   "text": "on the side street of joining."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.14,
   "end": 11.02,
   "text": "Cause I knew that neighborhood and that's what I did."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.06,
   "end": 12.92,
   "text": "And I did it through a partnership as well with family"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.92,
   "end": 14.12,
   "text": "to get the rest of the funds."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.36,
   "end": 16.96,
   "text": "Okay. So you moved out of your house hack."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.96,
   "end": 19.4,
   "text": "I assumed you kept it and you rented the unit out"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.4,
   "end": 20.26,
   "text": "that you were living in."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.26,
   "end": 21.64,
   "text": "So now that thing is cash flowing"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.64,
   "end": 23.58,
   "text": "cause you were already making money to live there."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.98,
   "end": 26.44,
   "text": "So now you've got one cash flowing asset."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.96,
   "end": 29.8,
   "text": "Then you rent hacked in Boston."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.44,
   "end": 33.64,
   "text": "So you decreased what it would cost you to live there."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.24,
   "end": 37.04,
   "text": "And your very next deal wasn't in Boston."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.26,
   "end": 40.2,
   "text": "It was actually a set of multifamilies"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.84,
   "end": 42.9,
   "text": "from a Louisville, Kentucky owner."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.12,
   "end": 45.7,
   "text": "Now was this somebody you knew already"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.7,
   "end": 47.74,
   "text": "or was this a deal you went hunting for?"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.42,
   "end": 49.98,
   "text": "It was one where I connected"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.98,
   "end": 51.46,
   "text": "with an investor friendly realtor"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.46,
   "end": 55.44,
   "text": "and she has now been my partner for many, many years."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.44,
   "end": 56.66,
   "text": "And we partner and other stuff together,"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.66,
   "end": 58.08,
   "text": "but it was through her network."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.46,
   "end": 62.34,
   "text": "It did hit the market, but it was 500 K to buy 12 units."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.86,
   "end": 64.62,
   "text": "And I was like, Hey, these numbers make a lot of."
  }
